                    {
                        "name":  "dsh-plugin-deepseek-usage",
                        "title":  {
                                      "en":  "Balance / Token usage",
                                      "zh":  "余额 / Token 用量"
                                  },
                        "description":  {
                                            "en":  "Adds a Balance/Token entry at the sidebar foot and shows the DeepSeek account full usage history, the UncensoredLLM relay balance and its local token usage: balance, spend, tokens and request counts, filterable by date, API key and model; both provider balances refresh about every 2 hours.",
                                            "zh":  "在左下角显示「余额/Token」入口，并在会话区查看 DeepSeek 账户全部历史用量、UncensoredLLM 中转余额与本机 Token 用量：余额、消费金额、Token 与调用次数，可按日期、API Key、模型筛选；两个账户余额约每 2 小时自动刷新。"
                                        },
                        "icon":  "icons/dsh-plugin-deepseek-usage.svg",
